{{! 
  Margin (outside space)
  m-*   — margin on all sides
  mt-*  — margin on top
  mb-*  — margin on bottom
  ms-*  — margin on the left (start)
  me-*  — margin on the right (end)
  mx-*  — margin left and right
  my-*  — margin top and bottom

  Padding (inside space)
  p-*   — padding on all sides
  pt-*  — padding on top
  pb-*  — padding on bottom
  ps-*  — padding on the left (start)
  pe-*  — padding on the right (end)
  px-*  — padding left and right
  py-*  — padding top and bottom

  Auto spacing (alignment)
  m-auto   — auto margin on all sides
  ms-auto  — push element to the right
  me-auto  — push element to the left

  Space between elements
  gap-*   — space between flex items
  g-*     — space between grid columns
  gx-*    — horizontal grid spacing
  gy-*    — vertical grid spacing

  Responsive spacing (by screen size)
  mt-sm-*  — margin-top on small screens
  mb-md-*  — margin-bottom on medium screens
  px-lg-*  — padding left and right on large screens

  Direction meaning
  ms-* — start (left in LTR)
  me-* — end (right in LTR)

 }}